<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - July 25.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - July 25.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THAWRA</p>
<p>- Iraq and U.N. Special Commission end talks on Iraq's weapons programmes.</p>
<p>- Some 9,000 tonnes of sugar arrive at Umm Qasr port in southern Iraq.</p>
<p>- Mosul University signs scientific and cultural agreement with Jordanian counterpart.</p>
<p>(The above were also carried by IRAQ)</p>
<p>IRAQ</p>
<p>- Jordanian labour delegation visiting Iraq.</p>
